<BugInfo xmlns="http://www.codesafe.cn/schema/rules" id="0702000010100029" language="Java">
			<Type>bug</Type>
			<Categories>
				<Category type="ClassChin">OWASP TOP 10</Category>
				<Category type="SubClassChin">配置管理</Category>
				<Category type="DetailClassChin">Struts配置错误：缺少forward标签的name属性</Category>
			</Categories>
			<BugServerity>1</BugServerity>
			<DynamicDescription><![CDATA[<p th:text="在+'`'+${fileName}+'`'+的第+'`'+${line}+'`'+行的forward标签缺少name属性。" th:remove="tag"></p>]]></DynamicDescription>
			<Description><![CDATA[缺少name属性的`<forward>`标签通常表示存在残留的调试代码或存在错误。  
  
**例如**：如下`forward`标签未指定name属性值  
```xml
<global-forwards>  
    ...  
    <forward name="loginHome" path="/TShirtLoginHome.do"/>  
    ...  
    <forward name="" path="/Jobs.do"/>   
</global-forwards>
```
]]></Description>
			<Advice><![CDATA[检查程序逻辑，增加`<forward>`标签的name属性。
]]></Advice>
			<References>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2017:A6 Security Misconfiguration</Reference>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2013:A5 Security Misconfiguration</Reference>
			</References>
